# Four hand-maintained config files under dataset/ are deliberately tracked
# (force-added): event_driven_items.csv, outlet_mapping.csv,
# outlet_name_overrides.csv, outlet_closures.csv. They hold data-owner
# decisions, not raw exports, and cannot be regenerated if lost. A negation
# pattern would not work here — git does not descend into an excluded
# directory — so new config files need `git add -f` as well.
